  "body": "Brand New | Freehold | Standalone | 4 Bedrooms + Study | Single Garage\r\n\r\nStep into a home where sophisticated architecture meets thoughtful design. With premium finishes, generous living spaces and attention to every detail, this stunning new residence offers something truly special.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a 211m² freehold section with a spacious 158m² floor area, this home is designed to impress while providing the comfort and functionality modern families deserve.\r\n\r\nWhat Makes This Home Special\r\n\r\n• 4 generous bedrooms + dedicated study – Perfect for family living and working from home.\r\n• 2 beautifully finished bathrooms, including master ensuite, plus separate WC.\r\n• Statement designer kitchen featuring luxurious 60mm engineered stone benchtops and sleek full-height cabinetry.\r\n•  Full-height premium Spanish tiling in both bathrooms and WC/laundry, delivering an elegant European-inspired finish.\r\n• Impressive 2.7m ceilings creating a bright, airy atmosphere throughout the open-plan living area.\r\n• Generous 14m² outdoor deck – An inviting space for alfresco dining and entertaining.\r\n•  10-Year Master Build Guarantee providing added confidence in your investment.\r\n\r\n A Location Families Will Love\r\n\r\nEnjoy the lifestyle of sought-after Bucklands Beach, with beautiful beaches, Half Moon Bay Marina, Howick Village, shopping and everyday conveniences all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nSchool zones listed for the original address include Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nA distinctive design. A desirable address. A beautiful place to call home.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing!",
